engine.go, loads, domain.plain
engine.go, loads, engine_connections.csv
engine.go, loads, engine_messages.csv
engine.go, loads, wire_messages.csv
domain, builds on, reconciliation

engine_connections.csv, is, a source
engine_connections.csv, gives the time in, at
engine_connections.csv, gives the entity in, connection
engine_connections.csv, gives the kind in, what
engine_connections.csv, opens with, connect
engine_connections.csv, closes with, disconnect
engine_connections.csv, calls its entities, "engine connection "
engine_connections.csv, gives the interval key in, port

engine_messages.csv, is, a source
engine_messages.csv, gives the time in, at
engine_messages.csv, gives the entity in, connection
engine_messages.csv, calls its entities, "engine messages of connection "
engine_messages.csv, gives the sequence in, seq
engine_messages.csv, gives the key part, order, order
engine_messages.csv, gives the key part, kind, kind

wire_messages.csv, is, a source
wire_messages.csv, gives the time in, seen
wire_messages.csv, gives the key part, order, order
wire_messages.csv, gives the key part, kind, kind
wire_messages.csv, gives the duplicate key in, packet
wire_messages.csv, gives the interval key in, src_port
wire_messages.csv, must fall inside the intervals of, engine_connections.csv

messages, is, a reconciliation
messages, has the golden view, engine_messages.csv
messages, checks, wire_messages.csv
messages, allows a time difference of, 5
messages, does not cover the golden rows with, connection, 49

an open twice, adds line, engine_connections.csv, 7000,49,connect,40049
an open twice, must break, Every open starts an interval

a close without an open, adds line, engine_connections.csv, 9000,99,disconnect,40099
a close without an open, must break, Every close ends an interval
a close without an open, must explain, '"engine_connections.csv:8, breaks, Every close ends an interval", holds because, "not engine_connections.csv:8, is, an interval end"'

a wire message after its session closed, adds line, wire_messages.csv, 2550,40048,201,new,9
a wire message after its session closed, must break, Every event falls inside an open interval
a wire message after its session closed, must explain, '"wire_messages.csv:10, breaks, Every event falls inside an open interval", holds because, "not wire_messages.csv:10, falls inside an interval of, engine_connections.csv"'

a message the wire dropped, adds line, engine_messages.csv, 3100,47,5,104,new
a message the wire dropped, adds line, engine_messages.csv, 3200,47,6,105,new
a message the wire dropped, adds line, wire_messages.csv, 3201,40047,105,new,9
a message the wire dropped, must break, No golden event is dropped
a message the wire dropped, must answer, true
a message the wire dropped, must explain, '"engine_messages.csv:11, breaks, No golden event is dropped", holds because, "engine_messages.csv:11, is dropped in, messages"'

a message the wire never saw, adds line, engine_messages.csv, 3100,47,5,104,new
a message the wire never saw, must break, No golden event is lost
a message the wire never saw, must explain, '"engine_messages.csv:11, breaks, No golden event is lost", holds because, "not engine_messages.csv:11, is dropped in, messages"'

a wire message nobody logged, adds line, wire_messages.csv, 3500,40047,999,new,9
a wire message nobody logged, must break, No checked event is invented
a wire message nobody logged, must answer, true
a wire message nobody logged, must explain, '"wire_messages.csv:10, breaks, No checked event is invented", holds because, "not wire_messages.csv:10, is matched in, messages"'

a wire message of another kind, adds line, wire_messages.csv, 1101,40047,101,replace,9
a wire message of another kind, must break, No checked event is invented

a duplicated wire message, adds line, wire_messages.csv, 1101,40047,101,new,1
a duplicated wire message, must break, No event is duplicated
a duplicated wire message, must answer, true
a duplicated wire message, must explain, '"wire_messages.csv:10, breaks, No event is duplicated", holds because, "wire_messages.csv:10, is a duplicate of, wire_messages.csv:2"'
